flowchart TD
    Start[Quote submitted] --> Api[POST /api/quotes]
    Api --> Store[(Quote saved)]
    Store --> HasDocs{CPF/CNPJ and total > 0?}
    HasDocs -->|yes| AutoGen[Auto-generate boleto]
    HasDocs -->|no| Skip[Skip auto generation]
    AutoGen --> Asaas[Asaas boleto created]
    Asaas --> PendingBoleto[Boleto pending]
    PendingBoleto --> Admin[Admin reviews quote]
    Admin --> Approve[Approve (records approvedAt)]
    Approve --> SendBoleto[Admin sends boleto email]
    SendBoleto --> Webhook[Asaas webhook paid]
    Webhook --> Approved[Status APPROVED]
    Approved --> Completed[Status COMPLETED (rental)]
    PendingBoleto --> Adjust[Final total adjusted]
    Adjust --> Regen[Regenerate pending boleto]
